      "content": "support groups don't really change the fact that every day is just the same slow decline. it's like i'm just stuck in this waiting room that never ends. sometimes i look at him and i just feel like we're already gone, you know? like there's nothing left for either of us but this pain. it feels so pointless to keep fighting against something that's already decided.",
